diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 0f75d81..1398c41 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -9,0 +10,12 @@
+### Added
+- Complete-outcome frozen-pool evaluation with separate labels and explicit cost scope.
+- Reproducible per-target refold selection with hash sampling, score ranking, diversity preference, manifests and checksum-verified replay.
+- Chain-aware interface metric parsing with ambiguity checks and explicit pairwise aggregation.
+- Privacy filtering for final parameter metadata.
+
+### Fixed
+- Keep Boltz complex and monomer cuEquivariance compiler caches in writable task directories.
+- Accept native AF2IG filtered score identifiers and reject conflicting identifier columns.
+- Request Boltz PAE output explicitly for downstream interface scoring.
+- Preserve zero DataLoader workers in BoltzGen wrappers and reject invalid worker counts.
+
